Usage: ruralz <noun> <verb> [ARGS] [FLAGS]

Commands:
  bundle build     Build a Revision, print its digest
  bundle diff      Compare FROM with TO
  bundle render    Render one Environment's one-file Bundle
  bundle validate  Offline validation, source-mapped diagnostics
  completion       Print a shell completion script
  dev run          Local ruralzd with Hot Reload
  dev tap          Stream redacted /tap metadata
  node drain       Drain the local ruralzd
  node dump        Save /config/dump, secrets omitted
  version          Version, commit, flavor, levels

Run 'ruralz help <command>' or 'ruralz <command> --help' for details.
